"10-K","filed":"2023-12-15"},"0000936395-24-000044":{"c":"CIEN","form":"10-K","filed":"2024-12-20"},"0001628280-25-056698":{"c":"CIEN","form":"10-K","filed":"2025-12-12"},"0000936395-24-000032":{"c":"CIEN","form":"10-Q","filed":"2024-09-04"},"0000936395-25-000011":{"c":"CIEN","form":"10-Q","filed":"2025-03-12"},"0000936395-25-000025":{"c":"CIEN","form":"10-Q","filed":"2025-06-05"},"0000936395-25-000041":{"c":"CIEN","form":"10-Q","filed":"2025-09-04"},"0001628280-26-015152":{"c":"CIEN","form":"10-Q","filed":"2026-03-05"},"0001628280-26-040767":{"c":"CIEN","form":"10-Q","filed":"2026-06-04"},"0001628280-26-060361":{"c":"CIEN","form":"10-Q","filed":"2026-09-03"},"0001193125-26-047977":{"c":"CIEN","form":"DEF 14A","filed":"2026-02-12"}},"finsights":{"CIEN":[{"topic":"fcf","text":"Free cash flow was $665 million in FY2025: operating cash flow of $806 million less capital spending of $141 million (computed from two filed figures). That is 13.9% of revenue. In FY2020 it was $411 million.","cites":["CIEN.ocf.2025","CIEN.capex.2025","CIEN.revenue.2025","CIEN.ocf.2020","CIEN.capex.2020"]},{"topic":"sbc","text":"Stock-based compensation was $185 million in FY2025, 3.9% of revenue, against 1.9% in FY2020.","cites":["CIEN.sbc.2025","CIEN.revenue.2025","CIEN.sbc.2020","CIEN.revenue.2020"]},{"topic":"returns","text":"In FY2025 the company paid $335 million to repurchase its own shares. No dividend payment is tagged for the year.","cites":["CIEN.buybacks.2025"]},{"topic":"quarter","text":"In the three months ended 2026-08-01 revenue was $1.7 billion, up 37% from $1.2 billion in the three months ended 2025-08-02.","cites":["CIEN.d.revenue.2026-05-03.2026-08-01","CIEN.d.revenue.2025-05-04.2025-08-02"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Over the four quarters to 2026-08-01 revenue added up to $6 billion (computed from five filed figures), operating income to $739 million and net income to $654 million.","cites":["CIEN.d.revenue.2024-11-03.2025-11-01","CIEN.d.revenue.2024-11-03.2025-08-02","CIEN.d.revenue.2025-11-02.2026-01-31","CIEN.d.revenue.2026-02-01.2026-05-02","CIEN.d.revenue.2026-05-03.2026-08-01","CIEN.d.opinc.2024-11-03.2025-11-01","CIEN.d.opinc.2024-11-03.2025-08-02","CIEN.d.opinc.2025-11-02.2026-01-31","CIEN.d.opinc.2026-02-01.2026-05-02","CIEN.d.opinc.2026-05-03.2026-08-01","CIEN.d.netinc.2024-11-03.2025-11-01","CIEN.d.netinc.2024-11-03.2025-08-02","CIEN.d.netinc.2025-11-02.2026-01-31","CIEN.d.netinc.2026-02-01.2026-05-02","CIEN.d.netinc.2026-05-03.2026-08-01"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Free cash flow over the same four quarters was $814 million: operating cash flow of $1.1 billion less capital spending of $240 million (computed from ten filed figures).","cites":["CIEN.d.ocf.2024-11-03.2025-11-01","CIEN.d.ocf.2024-11-03.2025-08-02","CIEN.d.ocf.2025-11-02.2026-01-31","CIEN.d.ocf.2025-11-02.2026-05-02","CIEN.d.ocf.2025-11-02.2026-08-01","CIEN.d.capex.2024-11-03.2025-11-01","CIEN.d.capex.2024-11-03.2025-08-02","CIEN.d.capex.2025-11-02.2026-01-31","CIEN.d.capex.2025-11-02.2026-05-02","CIEN.d.capex.2025-11-02.2026-08-01"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"The proxy statement filed 2026-02-12 gives the principal executive officer’s total pay for FY2025 as $18.5 million in its summary compensation table, and the “compensation actually paid” - the SEC’s measure, which revalues share awards over the year - as $94.5 million.","cites":["CIEN.pay.peoTotal.2025","CIEN.pay.peoPaid.2025"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"For the other named executive officers the same table gives an average of $5.5 million in total and $17.5 million actually paid.","cites":["CIEN.pay.neoTotal.2025","CIEN.pay.neoPaid.2025"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"The table puts the value of $100 held in the company’s shares over the years it covers at $482.15 at the end of FY2025, and $271.04 for the peer group the company chose.","cites":["CIEN.pay.tsr.2025","CIEN.pay.peerTsr.2025"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Remaining performance obligations - revenue under contract that was not yet recognised - were $2.1 billion at the end of FY2025, against $1.6 billion a year earlier. That is 44% of FY2025 revenue (computed from two filed figures).","cites":["CIEN.rpo.2025","CIEN.rpo.2024","CIEN.revenue.2025"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Deferred revenue was $304 million at the end of FY2025 (tagged ContractWithCustomerLiability), against $238 million a year earlier.","cites":["CIEN.deferred.2025","CIEN.deferred.2024"]},{"topic":"people","text":"The latest annual report gives the workforce as 9,080 in its own words. FY2025 revenue works out to about $525,000 for each (computed from one filed figure and the number in that sentence).","cites":["CIEN.q.employees","CIEN.revenue.2025"]},{"topic":"flags","text":"The FY2025 annual report tags restructuring charges of $112 million, after $24.6 million in FY2024.","cites":["CIEN.restructuring.2025","CIEN.restructuring.2024"]},{"topic":"debt","text":"At the end of FY2025 the balance sheet carried $1.1 billion in cash and cash equivalents and $216 million in short-term investments, and $1.5 billion of debt as tagged (LongTermDebtNoncurrent + LongTermDebtCurrent). Debt less cash and short-term investments was $228 million (computed from four filed figures).","cites":["CIEN.cash.2025","CIEN.sti.2025","CIEN.debtLong.2025","CIEN.debtCurrent.2025"]}]},"fin":{"CIEN":{"insiders":{"from":"2025-11-23","to":"2026-11-23","complete":true,"listed":124,"read":124,"other":0,"failed":0,"odd":0,"people":[["SMITH GARY B","President & CEO, director"],["Rothenstein David M","EVP & Chief Strategy Officer"],["Graff Marc D.","EVP & Chief Financial Officer"],["DiPerna Dino","EVP & Chief R&D Officer"],["Gage Brodie","EVP & Chief Product & Tech"],["Phipps Jason","EVP & Chief Customer Officer"],["Kosaraju Sheela","EVP & Chief Legal Officer"],["Cumello Joseph","EVP & General Mgr."],["Claflin Bruce L.","Director"],["NEVENS THOMAS MICHAEL","Director"],["Gage Brodie","EVP & Chief Product &"],["SMITH GARY B","President, CEO, director"],["Gage Brodie","SVP Global Products & Supp